<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">1Phixiroosa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phixiroosa xaafeez tiina Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Phixiroosa</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Phix.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phixiroosa Xaafeez Tiina Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Hawaare Phixiroosa xaafeez tiina kiitay xaafintteezay, «Doorintteez Xooss Asita» ginttinttii xeegintteezitayisinnee Xiqqa Iisiya gade pude bagga laalintteez ammaniza asayisii. Yha kiitayis aafe qofay, ammanopp denddeezayid metonnee waaye helleez asa minthathodayisii. Yha maxafatto xaafeezay, Yesuusa yhayiqo, E denddo, E nam7intho yi7itha odiza Yesuus Kiristtoosa Wonggile qaala unttan qopisiza. Yesuus Kiristtoosa de7o aaziso udii bi7ii, meto danda7ar kanthod garkk unttan qofisiza. Yeyir woli helthii, meto u ammanay geeshshetitha paaccizannee, «Yesuus Kiristtoosa qoncciz gallas» beeziza woyito unttii ekkodayis yezana qopisiza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Xaafay, unttii meto danda7od garkk minthathayil afa Kiristtoosa kaalliza asitay yezodayis beeziza yessi yessaday garkk qofisiza.</para>
  <para style="iot">1 Phixiroosa kiitay aykkeez qofita</para>
  <para style="io1">Sarotho <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoossii nuus inggeez atotitha <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 1:3-12">1:3-12</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Geeshshetith yessi <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 1:13-2:10">1:13—2:10</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Meto wode ammaniza asay hanodayis beeziza baz <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 2:11-4:19">2:11—4:19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Chirstaanitay haayotithinnee ooso <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kustte qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="1PE 5:12-14">5:12-14</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1"/>Taanii, Yesuus Kiristtoosa hawaaray Phixiroosa; Phanxoosa, Galata, Qaphadooqa, Iisannee Bitaana gade bete as garkk laalinttii yez Xoossii dooreez, asayis yha dabddaabba xaafeeza. <verse eid="1PE 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2"/>Yesuus Kiristtoosas yi kiitinttod garkkennee E suuthar geezhoday garkk, Xooss Aday fa tiina erar dooreezitaysinnee Geeshsha Ayyanar geezheez, yinttis aadho keehatithinnee sarotithii maaqqo.<verse eid="1PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Medhina ufayis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3"/>Yesuus Kiristtoosana yhayiqopp denthii fa gita maarotithayir nam7antho yelinttayir dhaboowa ufayss inggeez nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa Aday, Xoossay galatintto. <verse eid="1PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4"/>Ma Xoossii yinttis dhaboowa, iitoozannee buuqqowa gade salo giigiseeza. <verse eid="1PE 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5"/>Ye laatay wode wurssitha qonccodayis yez atotithis Xooss wolqqar ammanor yinttis naaginttii yeza.<verse eid="1PE 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6"/>Yhatti xiqqa wodes yi duma duma paacer un77inttikokka yeyid ufayttoytta. <verse eid="1PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7"/>Ye paacay yinttan helleezay, tama olin dhabiza worqqepp yi ammanay aadhonnee tuma maaqqeezana beeziza. Ye paacintteez ammanayid Yesuus Kiristtoosa maaqqii ye7odar galata, bonchchonnee Saaba yi ekkoda. <verse eid="1PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8"/>Yi Yesuusa be7ekkaya, zin eza siiqiza. Yi yhatti eza be7ekka baz maaqqikokka, eza ammaniza. Ma odar qonccisodayis danda7inttoowa ufayssarannee bonchchor kumeeza. <verse eid="1PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9"/>Yi ammanor naagiza yi shemppo atotitha ekkoda.<verse eid="1PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10"/>Aadho keehetithay baggar yinttis maaqqeez yha atotithay bagga nabitay erodayis lo7ithii pilagii koyeeza. <verse eid="1PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11"/>U gancce yez Kiristtoosa Ayyanay eza hellod waayannee yeypp guye ye7od bonchcho bagga tiinatii markkattittar, ayide woy wayizii hanodazakko akaakar pilagii koyeeza. <verse eid="1PE 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12"/>Nabitay odeez tinbbitay paas baazin yinttis maaqqeezana Xoossii unttis qoncciseeza. Yhatti asay yinttis odeez Wonggile salopp kiitintteez Geeshsha Ayyana wolqqar yinttis odeeza. Kiitanchchitaykka yeya be7adayis amottiza.<verse eid="1PE 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Geeshshatithar yessi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13"/>Yeyi gishos, yi wozina barkithii oosos giiginttii; yinttan mooddii Yesuus Kiristtoosa maaqqii ye7odar yi ekkod aadho keehatitha ufayisar naagoytta. <verse eid="1PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14"/>Kiitinttiza na7ita aazii erekkazar tiina yi yezeez iita amo kaallippate. <verse eid="1PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15"/>Zini yinttan xeegeez Xoossay geeshsh maaqqeezay garkk yinttikka yi yessa ubbayid geesh maaqqoytta. <verse eid="1PE 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16"/>Geeshsha Maxaafayid, «Taanii geeshshi maaqqeez gishos yinttikka geeshshita maaqqoytta» ginttinttii xaafintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:44-45">Lewii. 11:44-45</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:2">19:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17"/>As sino be7ekkazar pettayis pettayis e oosay garkk pirddiza Xoossa, «Ade» gi xeegiz baz maaqqiko, yha sa7a imathatith yessa yashshar yezoytta. <verse eid="1PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18"/>Yi, yi aditaypp laatteez pathoowa yessaypp wozintteezay, dhabiza birar woy worqqar baazana yi eriza. <verse eid="1PE 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19"/>Boro woy borso baa dur maaqqeez al7o Kiristtoosa suuthar yi wozintteeza. <verse eid="1PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20"/>E alame medhinttodaypp tiina erintteeza, zin yha wurssith wode yi gishos qoncceeza. <verse eid="1PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21"/>Yi ammanayinnee yi ufayssay Xoossal maaqqoday garkk Xoossii eza yhayiqopp denthii, bonchcheez Kiristtoosa baggar Xoossal ammaninttoda. <verse eid="1PE 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22"/>Yi tumas azazinttittar uttirabayth ishetith siiqor miinthii woli wozinapp siiqoytta.<verse eid="1PE 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23"/>Yi nam7antho yelintteezay dhabiz zerethapp baazin medhinas yez Xooss qaalayid dhaboowa sheeshapp yelintteeza. <verse eid="1PE 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24"/>Xooss qaalay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">«Asho ma77eez ubbay maata garkke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">e bonchchay ubbaykka maata fudhe garkke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Maatay meliza, fudhitaykka gufiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Isa. 40:6-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25"/>Zini Goday qaalay medhinas miinggii yezoda»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">yeegiza. Yinttis odintteez Wonggile qaalay yhaya.<verse eid="1PE 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2"/>
  <para style="s1">De7o shuchchinnee doorintteez woya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1"/>Yikkee iitatithi ubba, doosha ubba, cubbotithi qinaatennee zigirssi ubba yinttipp haasoytta. <verse eid="1PE 2:1"/><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2-3"/>Goday keeha maaqqeezana yi ereezay garkk yhatti yelintteez xiqqa na7itay garkk yi atotithar diccodayis gene baa qaala maathi ubba wode amottoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2-3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:8">Maz. 34:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:2-3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4"/>Asar borinttii Xoossar doorintteez bonchcho maaqqeez shuchch, Goda Yesuusako shiiqoytta. <verse eid="1PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5"/>Yi de7o shuchita maaqqii, Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggar Xooss ufayssiza ayyana yarshsho yarshshiza geesh qeesita maaqqoday garkk Ayyana keethi maaqqii keexxinttoytta. <verse eid="1PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6"/>Geeshsha Maxaafayid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">«Yeezako, taanii Xiyone katama keetha muumer tookkii aykkiz kirkiro garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">doorintteez, bonchcho shuchch gaddoda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">eza ammaniza oonkka yesha yeellataamii»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:6">yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa. 28:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7"/>Yha shuchchay yinttis ammanizitayis boncho, zin ammanowazitayis,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">«Gimbbizitay leqqii ixxeez shuchchay</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">keetha muumer tookkii aykkiz kirkiro garkk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">ubbaypp aadhiz shuchch maaqqeeza.»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Maz. 118:22</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8"/>Maakka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">«Yha shuchchay as dhubbiza shuchchinnee as pokisiz zaalla»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">yeegiza. Unttii yeyis qaadintteez gishos Xooss qaala kiitinttaam ixxii dhubintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:14-15">Isa. 8:14-15</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9"/>Zini Xoossii dhumapp malalisiza fa poo7ayko yinttan xeegeezay, yi e lo77otitha haritayis ododayis doorintteez kochch, kaat qeese, geeshi yeletithinnee Xooss duma woya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5-6">Kes. 19:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:20-21">Isa. 43:20-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Nam7i. 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:6">7:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tito 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isa. 9:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10"/>Yi tiina Xooss woya baaya, zin yhatti yi e woya. Yi tiina maarotithi denggekkazita, zin yhatti maarotithi denggeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hosa. 2:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xooss aylle garkk yess</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11"/>Ta ishuntho, yi yha sa7a imathinnee bete as maaqqeezay garkk yi shemppo oliza asho amopp haakkod garkk taanii yinttan woosiza. <verse eid="1PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12"/>Ammanoowa asay yinttan iita oothiz as garkk zigiriko Xoossii nuna be7adayis yi7iza gallas, unttii yi lo77o oosa bi7ii Xoossa galatoday garkk yinttis lo77o de7o yezo.<verse eid="1PE 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13"/>Goday gishos gi mawuter yez asayis haarinttoytta; ubbaypp afa maaqqeez gishos kaatayiskka moodinttoytta. <verse eid="1PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14"/>Unttii iita oothizita seerodayisinnee lo77o oothizita sabbodayis kaataypp kiitintteez gishos gade aqizitayis haarinttoytta. <verse eid="1PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15"/>Yi, yi lo77o oosor eroowa boozo asay nashsha doona ayithoday Xooss shene. <verse eid="1PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16"/>Xooss aylle maaqqii wallo yezoyttap attin yi wallotitha iita oosos kame udippate. <verse eid="1PE 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17"/>As ubba bonchchoytta; ammaniza asa siiqoytta; Xoossis yashittooytta; kaat bonchchoytta.<verse eid="1PE 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosa waayayis aaziso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18"/>Aylluntho, lo77o goditayisinnee keeha goditayis aadda baazin iititayiskka bonchchor haarinttoytta. <verse eid="1PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19"/>Asii Xooss gishos gi beezoowa waaye ekkiko Xooss eza anjjoda. <verse eid="1PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20"/>Zini yi nagara oothin yinttan yhadhdhin yi danda7iko yinttis aba galata yenee? Zini lo77o baz udii waaye danda7iko Xoossii yinttan yeyis anjjoda. <verse eid="1PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21"/>Xoossii yinttan xeegeezay yey gishos; Kiristtoosa yinttis waayintteeza; yi eza kaalloday garkk, yinttis aaziso maaqqeeza. <verse eid="1PE 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22"/>E nagara oothekkaya; e doonayidakka cubbotith benttekkaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:9">Isa. 53:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23"/>Unttii eza cazhizin E mahii cazhekkaya. Zini waaye ekkittar xillo pirddiza Xoossayis fa pirdda ashshii ashshenepp attin manddekkaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa. 53:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24"/>Nuunii nagaras yhayqqii xillotithis yezodaygarkk Kiristtoosa fa ashayid nu nagara mazqalel afa tookkeeza; yi e madothayir paxeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:5">Isa. 53:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25"/>Binii yi oge balii laalinttii dhabeez dur garkke, zin yhatti yi shemppo heenggizayikonnee naagizayiko maaqqeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:6">Isa. 53:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Azin baggannee machchii bagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1"/>Maakka, machchitayyo, yi azinatayis azazinttoytta. Yey garkk pettii pettii Xooss qaala ammanoozita maaqqikokka fa machchitay hana bi7ii qaala odekkazin ammanodayis danda7iza. <verse eid="1PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2"/>Ammanodayis danda7izay yashshattitharannee yi geesh yessa bi7ii.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:22">Efi. 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:18">Qol. 3:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3"/>Yi, yi omma datharannee worqqe aasor woy lo77o ma7or buqurinttor yi asii beezor maaqqippe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:9">1 Xim. 2:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4"/>Zini yi wozinay gancce yez yegelsatithay Xooss tiina yinttis gaame al7o maaqqii dhaboowa, ashikkennee dacci geez ayyana maaqqo. <verse eid="1PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5"/>Xoossii inggod geezana ammaneez geesh maachchitay binii wode fa azinitayis haarinttii, fana yey garkk usa loytheeza. <verse eid="1PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6"/>Yey garkk Saara Afraamena, «Ta godayyo» yeegii xeegittar, ees kiitintteeza; akkokka yashittekkar lo77o baz oothiko yinttikka I na7ita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:12">Medhe. 18:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7"/>Azinitayyo, yi machchitay yinttipp daabura medho maaqqeezana erii, unttan bonchchoytta; yi woosa dhubbaamay garkk Xoossii inggeez de7o unttii yinttar wolla laattiza gishos unttan bonchchoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:25">Efi. 5:25</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:19">Qol. 3:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Lo77o oosor meto eko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8"/>Yhanpp guye, ubbitay pettii qofar yezoytta. Yhankkitay metay yinttan heleezay garkk udoytta, ishetith siiqor woli siiqoytta; ma pettay pettayis keehitannee ashikkita maaqqoytta. <verse eid="1PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9"/>Iita gishos iita woy cashsh gishos cazhii mahipatte; yeya ashshii, Xoossii yinttis anjjo inggodayis yinttan xeegeez gishos anjjoytta. <verse eid="1PE 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10"/>Abis giiko, Geeshsha Maxaafay,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">«De7o dosizayinnee lo77o gallasita be7adayis koyiz oona maaqqikokka fa inxarssa iitabazinnee metersha wordo odinttizana kayo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:12-16">Maz. 34:12-16</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11"/>Iita bazapp haakko lo77o baz ootho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">sarotithikka koyonnee kaallo.<verse eid="1PE 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12"/>Goday aafitay xillita bi7iza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">E hayitayikka ubba wode u woosa si7odayis dooyinttii yeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">Zini Goday iita baz oothizita fa shene aafer bi7iza»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 3:12">yeegiza.<verse eid="1PE 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13"/>Yi lo77o baz oothodayis amottikko yinttan kayoday oonoo? <verse eid="1PE 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14"/>Hara attozin, xillotith gishos yi waayinttiko anjjintteezita. Asis yashittiipatennee hirigipate.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:10">Mat. 5:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:12-13">Isa. 8:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15"/>Kiristtoosana yi wozinapp bonchchoyttannee god mahoytta. Yinttis inggeez ufayssa oyciz ooskka mahith inggodayis ubba wode giigii bettoytta, zin yeya haayotitharannee yashshar udoytta. <verse eid="1PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16"/>Ma Kiristtoosar yi yez lo77o yessa iita baz ootheezay garkk, yinttan cazhiza asaynnee hawozizitay yeellatoday garkk yi kahay geeshi maaqqo. <verse eid="1PE 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17"/>Xooss shene maaqqiko iita baz oothii waaye ekkizaypp lo77o baz oothii waaye ekkizay lo77o. <verse eid="1PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18"/>Kiristtoosa nuna Xoossiko shiishodayis fa ubbas geeshi maaqqii yezar, nagaranchchitay ubbitayis lammamayis pettii toke nagara gishos yhayqqeeza; E fa asetithayir yhayqqeezar, zin ayyanar path. <verse eid="1PE 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19"/>Ma ye ayyanayir E yhanigii achch kara yez shemppitayis qaala odeeza. <verse eid="1PE 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20"/>Nohe markkabe keexxodar ye shemppitay Xoossis kiitinttaam ixxeeza, zin Xooss unttan danda7eeza. Hosppun as aadda markkabe gelii, pirdda haathaap atteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:1-7:24">Medhe. 6:1—7:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21"/>Ye pirdda haathay yhatti yinttan ashshiza xinqqate aaziso maaqqeeza. Yha xinqqatay galla qita meecco baazin lo77o kahar Xooss tiina qaala gelo, Kiristtoosa denddo baggar yinttan ashshiza. <verse eid="1PE 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22"/>E salo yhanigii Xooss ushachcha betteeza, kiitanchchitay, mawute aditanne wolqqamita haariza.<verse eid="1PE 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Xoossis yezo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1"/>Kiristtoosa fa ashor nuus metto ekkeez gishos yinttikka ola miishe dancceez as garkk ye qofayir miinggii eqqoytta. Kiristtoosa gishos gi fa ashor waaye ekkeez athay nagara oothaam gi murtteez asii. <verse eid="1PE 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2"/>Ye athay fa atteez laytha Xooss shene oothodayis koyinepp attin iita asho amo polodayis baaya. <verse eid="1PE 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3"/>Binii yi ammanoowa asay yezeezay garkk yezeeza. Yi qayxer, iita asho amor, aqqopp aath ushshar, mather, tuna ootho denthithiza yethar, yelathiza eeqa goynnor tiina yezeez yessay gidoda. <verse eid="1PE 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4"/>Ammanoowa asayira yi yey garkk bazar qayixinttii laasoowa gishos malabaz gi yinttan cazhiza. <verse eid="1PE 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5"/>Zini unttii paxitayilannee yhayqqeezitayil afa pirddodayis yez Xoossayis mahith inggoda. <verse eid="1PE 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6"/>Yhayqqeezitayiskka Wonggilay sabbakintteezay yhay gishos. Unttii asayisay garkk fa ashor pirddinttoda ma fa ayyanar Xoossay garkk de7o yezoda.<verse eid="1PE 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7"/>Yikkee, ubbabazis wurssithay ukkeeza. Yeyi gishos, woossodayis danda7inttod garkk dacci geez wozina maarara yezoytta. <verse eid="1PE 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8"/>Siiqo gaame nagara kammiza gishos ubbaypp aathii wolir wozinapp siiqinttoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Aazi. 10:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9"/>Oollekkazar woli imathatithar mokkoytta. <verse eid="1PE 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10"/>Yi Xoossaypp aadho keehatithaypp duma duma imota ekkeezay garkk yi pettay pettay ye ima beezizay garkk aykkii woli maaddoytta. <verse eid="1PE 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11"/>Yesuus Kiristtoosa baggar ubba bazar Xoossii galatinttoday garkk oonkka odiza baz maaqqiko Xoossapp qaala ekkeezay garkk odo. Ma oonkka maaddiza baz maaqqiko Xoossii ees inggiza wolqqay garkk maaddo. Bonchchonnee wolqqay medhinapp medhina hellodayis ees maaqqo. Amin7e.<verse eid="1PE 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Metto gancce garzho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12"/>Ta bagguntho, yi tama garkk xuuggiz waaye paace ganccer aadhodar oorothibaz haneezay garkk malabaz giippate. <verse eid="1PE 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13"/>Zini E fa bonchchayir maaqqii ye7odar yi ufayssay usa gujjoday garkk Kiristtoosa waaye yi ekkizayid ufayttoytta. <verse eid="1PE 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14"/>Kiristtoosa sunthay gishos as yinttan cazhiko Xooss bonchcho Ayyanay yinttal afa shemppiza gishos yi anjjintteezita. <verse eid="1PE 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15"/>Yinttapp meto ekkiz oonkka shemppo wodheezitay garkk woy kastteez woy iita ootheezay garkk woy gelisowa aqo geleezay garkk hanii meto ekkippe. <verse eid="1PE 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16"/>Hano zin, chirsttaanee maaqqeez gishos meto ekkiko Kiristtoosa sunthay gishos Xoossa galatopp attin yeellatippee.<verse eid="1PE 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17"/>Pirdda Xooss asaypp aykkiz wode helleeza. Yikkee, ye pirdday tiina nuul aykkizibaz maaqqiko, Xooss Wonggilayis Kiitinttoowa asay wurssithay abi maaqqode? <verse eid="1PE 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18"/>Xillay un77ar attizibaz maaqqiko, zhucitayinnee nagaranchchitay yeezin wayode?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">Aazi. 11:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19"/>Yeyi gishos, Xooss shene garkk meto ekkizitay fa shemppo hadara fana medhdheez, ammanthiza Xoossayis inggittar lo77o baz ootho.<verse eid="1PE 4:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Xooss woya aqiso woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1"/>Yikkee, woosa keeth aqisiza cima maaqqeez ta, Kiristtoosa ekkeez metayis markka maaqqeezannee qonccodayis yez bonchcha shaginttodayis yez taanii, yi gancce yez woosa keeth aqisiz cimita zoriza. <verse eid="1PE 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2"/>Yi adetithayis oommor yez Xooss wuda heenggoytta. Xooss shene garkk qadhdherannee dosorapp attin wolqqanthor heenggippate. Ma miishe koshshar baazin lo77o qofar heenggoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:15-17">Wan. 21:15-17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3"/>Yi adetithapp oommor yez wudes lo77o aaziso maaqqoyttapp attin godatippatte. <verse eid="1PE 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4"/>Heenggizitay halaqay maaqqii ye7odar aadhoowa bonchcho zawude yi ekkoda.<verse eid="1PE 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5"/>Yey garkkekka, yelagitayyo, cimitayis kiitinttoytta. Yi wolis haayo maaqqoytta. Geeshsha Maxaafayid, «Xooss utirttizita ixxiza, zin haayitayis aadho keehatithapp inggiza» yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:34">Aazi. 3:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6"/>Yikkee Xooss fa wode yinttan bonchchoday garkk wolqqama Xooss kushepp oommor yinttan kawushshoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat. 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luq. 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">18:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7"/>E yinttis qoppiza gishos yinttan hirigisiza baz ubba ezal afa oloytta.<verse eid="1PE 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8"/>Yi morkke daabuloosa, mittodana koyii, gaammo garkk xaaggittar yi kanttar yuuyizay gishos yinttan haaroyttannee barkkoytta. <verse eid="1PE 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9"/>Alamel yez yi ishitay yey garkk meto ekkodana erii, ammanor miinggii, Xalaher eqinttoytta. <verse eid="1PE 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10"/>Fa medhina bonchchayis Kiristtoosa Yesuusa baggar yinttan xeegeez aadho keehatith ubbay Xoossay, xiqqa wodes yi meto ekkeezaypp guye, E fa ommas yinttan folo udoda, kaatisoda, miinthii essoda, xaphphisoda. <verse eid="1PE 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11"/>Medhinapp medhina hellodayis bonchchonnee wolqqa ees maaqqo. Amin77ii.<verse eid="1PE 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssith sarotho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12"/>Ammanintteez ishe gi ta ekkiz Sillaase baggar yha dabddaabba yinttis haatar xaafeeza. Ta yeya yinttis xaafeezay, yinttan zorodayisinnee Xooss aadho keehatithay tuma maaqqeezana markkattatodayis. Ye aadho keehatithayid miinggii eqqoytta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:22">Haw. O. 15:22</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 15:40">40</ref></char></note><verse eid="1PE 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13"/>Yinttar wolla doorintteez Baabiloone<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Baabilooner: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yha aqo Baabiloone giinttintteezay Oroome katama maaqqth attenna.</char></note> ginttinttiz oroome yez woosa keeth ta na7a Marqqoosa yinttan, «Saro saro» yeegiza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Haw. O. 12:12</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Qol. 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Film. 24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1PE 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14"/>Siiqo yeera yeerinttittar, woli sarothoytta.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Kiristtoosar yez yi ubbayis saro maaqqo. Amin77ii.<verse eid="1PE 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5"/>
</usx>
